   "spoken": "After the knight grabs on e5 and Black plays for the centre, the key is the pawn to d4 — solidifying the strong knight rather than the loosening queen move. Build a pawn wall and finish developing.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Support your advanced piece with a pawn (d4) instead of a committal queen move.",
   "plans": "Develop the pieces around the extra pawn."
